WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.007 --> 00:00:10.636
"See" takes place about 600 years after
a viral apocalypse.

00:00:10.677 --> 00:00:13.847
Those who survive are left blind,

00:00:13.889 --> 00:00:17.351
and the world has gone back to
a tribal culture.

00:00:18.393 --> 00:00:20.229
It's so very different.

00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:21.813
It's just something
that has never been done before.

00:00:26.026 --> 00:00:27.486
We've been working to build this world,

00:00:27.528 --> 00:00:29.696
what it would look like,
what it would feel like.

00:00:34.701 --> 00:00:37.204
The world has been rebuilding itself,

00:00:37.246 --> 00:00:40.207
both in the natural environment
that we see here,

00:00:40.249 --> 00:00:43.877
but also the kind of people
and how they live together.

00:00:43.919 --> 00:00:47.130
There is a beauty about it, mankind,

00:00:47.172 --> 00:00:48.882
with nothing to distract

00:00:48.924 --> 00:00:51.051
other than to keep life going.

00:00:53.846 --> 00:00:55.556
The idea is that the human beings

00:00:55.597 --> 00:00:56.598
who did all the damage to the Earth

00:00:56.682 --> 00:00:58.851
in the first place can't see it.

00:00:58.892 --> 00:01:00.018
Then vision comes back.

00:01:02.688 --> 00:01:04.022
What is it?

00:01:04.064 --> 00:01:06.191
Something's different.

00:01:06.233 --> 00:01:09.027
The children.
They have the ability to see.

00:01:09.695 --> 00:01:11.572
Characters who are
blind or visually impaired

00:01:11.613 --> 00:01:13.031
haven't often had an opportunity

00:01:13.073 --> 00:01:17.744
to portray aspects outside of
showing off their disability.

00:01:17.786 --> 00:01:19.705
I train actors how we move
through the world,

00:01:19.746 --> 00:01:20.914
and help them understand

00:01:20.956 --> 00:01:23.876
how people utilize their senses
in a different way.

00:01:25.169 --> 00:01:26.587
They will come for us.

00:01:26.628 --> 00:01:28.088
Prepare for a long journey.

00:01:31.175 --> 00:01:32.217
Action-packed.

00:01:32.259 --> 00:01:35.304
So much cool stuff in a world
that we've never seen before.

00:01:38.182 --> 00:01:39.975
This is our home.

00:01:40.017 --> 00:01:42.352
We are one.

00:01:42.394 --> 00:01:43.770
And we fight as one.

